    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="143ac4e5-54fe-5961-92f0-4eba33b10bc8" activityNameId="03bc5bb4-5048-551f-bb97-20f80518261c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, low voltage, production from waste incineration, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, low voltage, production from waste incineration, at grid
This dataset describes the transformation from medium to low voltage as well as the distribution of electricity at low voltage.;
UUID: 881e5f8c-5546-34bd-9f98-6b0446767032
Included are the electricity production in 0, the transmission network as well as direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during low-voltage transmission and transformation from medium-voltage are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on Swiss data.
Technology: Average technology used to distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines, as well as air- and SF6-insulated medium-to-low voltage switching stations. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: total electricity in Switzerland: 60 TWh
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_881e5f8c-5546-34bd-9f98-6b0446767032.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
